                "block_type": "display-math",
                "text": "",
                "latex": "|y(t)|\\\\le 3e^{-2t}+\\\\int_0^t e^{-2(t-\\\\tau)}\\\\cdot1\\\\,d\\\\tau\\\\le 3+\\frac{1-e^{-2t}}{2}\\\\le\\frac{7}{2}",
                "image_slot_id": ""
              },
              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The homogeneous part decays and the bounded-input contribution is limited by a decaying kernel, so the response is bounded.",
